From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: michael moore <mrmoore27@pm.me>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 09:35:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/8] lazarus-gateway: attest every pooled job with LZT1 and
 send it to Prime (0x5A)

SOV-P-002 W12. With lzt1_attest (needs identity_key_file), the gateway
builds A for each pooled job's coinbase (parent, merkle branches, payout
digest over the final outputs incl. the witness commitment, node view),
signs it with its DATUM identity key, appends the 70-byte LZT1 commitment
(79 bytes reserved in the template's weight budget) and sends
0x5A | job | variant | A | sig on the urgent queue before the notify, so
Prime has it ahead of the job's first share. lazarus_protocol::lzt1 is
held byte for byte to prime's authorship fixture. Default off.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
