++ *
++ * Lazarus: persisted DATUM identity key and LZT1 template attestations.
++ *
++ * Per published coinbase variant of a pooled job the gateway signs an
++ * attestation A with its DATUM identity key G (the ed25519 key of the
++ * handshake), commits to it in that coinbase with one zero-value output
++ *
++ *     OP_RETURN PUSH68 "LZT1" BLAKE2b-256(A) G           (70-byte script)
++ *
++ * and sends A and its signature to Prime as mining sub-command 0x5A before
